  "name": "Ethereal Tool Dispenser crate payout and the rod upgrade (#6627)",
  "contract": "The Ethereal Tool Dispenser Crate (8263511) is consumed once and replaces itself in the bags with the Ethereal Tool Dispenser (8263501), the convenience item whose own item category lets it stand in for the eight profession tools. Using the Dispenser takes up the trade of the highest Runed Rod the opener carries: a Runed Arcanite Rod (16207) turns it into Dispenser I (8263502), a Runed Eternium Rod (22463) into Dispenser II (8263503), and a Runed Titanium Rod (44452) into Dispenser III (8263504), in one step and without passing through the tiers below. The rod itself is kept, and a Dispenser that is already high enough is neither spent, downgraded nor replaced when it is used again. A shaman totem (Earth Totem 5175, category 2) is not a rod: it cannot upgrade a Dispenser, and carrying one must not stop a rod from upgrading it. Every refused use says so in a system message instead of silently doing nothing.",
